SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new logo also featured in a See for
OL,7,FYourself supplement in the 2nd ` 8th
OL,8,FJanuary 1988 issue of the Radio Times.
OL,10,FThe introduction of this version of the
OL,11,Flogo was gradual.
OL,13,FIt was the latest evolution of the BBC
OL,14,Fboxes first seen in the late-50s.
OL,16,FBut from the mid-70s on, the corporate
OL,17,Flogo was used less and less on screen `
OL,18,Fit was notably withdrawn from the BBC
OL,19,FOne idents in 1974 and from generic
OL,20,Fnews bulletins in 1976.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13903
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F139A1781651786
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter about 1982 it was rarely seen
OL,7,Fexcept in the copyright tag on end
OL,8,Fcredits.
OL,10,FThe corporate logo, by stealth, came to
OL,11,Fbe seen purely as the logo of the
OL,12,Fcorporation itself ` not as part of the
OL,13,Fbranding for its services.
OL,15,FThe decision to invest in a new logo in
OL,16,F1987 was an interesting one. It came at
OL,17,Fa time when the BBC was under fire and
OL,18,Fneeded to reassert itself and regain
OL,19,Fits confidence.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13904
