OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Breakfast News launched with a
OL,7,Fgraphic forming the letters BBC with no
OL,8,Frelation whatsoever to the corporate
OL,9,Flogo.
OL,11,FIt took until 1993 for the BBC News to
OL,12,Fbe rebranded and consistently use the
OL,13,Fcorporate logo though it started
OL,14,Fcreeping in about two years before.
OL,16,FCopyright tags started using it as
OL,17,Fstandard on 1st January 1990.
OL,19,FAnd presentation, of course, started
OL,20,Fusing the corporate logo with the
OL,21,FFebruary 1991 rebrand.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
