OL,3,GFEATURESCWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo was there always a long-term plan to
OL,7,Fuse the logo prominently? Or did it
OL,8,Fhappen by stealth as branding became
OL,9,Fmore important with the start of
OL,10,Fmultichannel TV?
OL,12,FIt would be interesting to know.
OL,23,APub: 26-Aug-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
